<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  «Локальный прокси» (LocalProxyActivity) — handoff README §7, «Единое лекало».
  ============================================================================

      кнопка назад 44dp → заголовок 24sp/700 → группы карточек с теми же
      строками, что и в настройках

  The header is @layout/view_sub_header, so the screen no longer runs through
  BaseActivity.setContentViewWithToolbar and its 16sp MaterialToolbar title.

  WHAT CHANGED IN EVERY ROW, and why each one is one line of §6's «Строка»:

      плитка 40dp r12, нейтральный фон, глиф 22dp   @style/Widget.Departament.Tile
      → 16dp → заголовок 14sp/400 + подпись 12.5sp  Body + Caption
      → справа значение 13sp или переключатель      Subtitle / MaterialSwitch
      правый отступ 12dp только при значении/тумблере
      высота от 56dp, растёт с подписью             @style/Widget.Departament.Row

  RIPPLE IS GONE, and this file is where most of the app's last ripples lived.
  ?attr/selectableItemBackground became @drawable/bg_row (a ColorStateList with
  state_pressed stepping DOWN to ?attr/colorPressBg) plus @anim/press_row 0.975 on
  the stateListAnimator; ?attr/selectableItemBackgroundBorderless on the copy /
  reveal glyphs became @drawable/bg_control_disc plus @anim/press_icon 0.88. §1:
  «Никакой подсветки вокруг кнопки и никакого ripple».

  THE TILES ARE NEUTRAL NOW. They were purple / red / green / orange, which is a
  category system this product does not have (D-5) and which the prototype does not
  draw — every tile on every sub-screen in it is the one neutral plate. §9 also
  forbids painting a tile from a layout at all; @style/Widget.Departament.Tile
  resolves both the fill and the glyph tint from the theme.

  WHAT IS ON THIS SCREEN THAT §7 DOES NOT LIST, AND STAYS:

    · Адрес / Порт локального прокси. §7's «Локальный прокси» group names five
      toggles and no fields; the port is the one value on this screen a user has an
      actual reason to change, and it was already unreachable once (it used to hide
      behind SOCKS5 auth). Kept.
    · The hotspot detail block — endpoint, login, password, three copy glyphs, the
      «открыт для всей локальной сети» warning. §7 lists «Доступ через хотспот» as
      a bare toggle; a toggle that opens a proxy to the LAN without showing the
      address to point a device at is a dead switch.
    · «Сбросить учётные данные». §7 spells it «Сбросить логин/пароль» as a link row;
      the repo's string and its confirm flow are the ones that exist.

  WHAT §7 LISTS AND THIS SCREEN DOES NOT HAVE: the «Память» group («Лимит
  оперативной памяти», «Снять ограничение»), «Скрыть значок (только прокси)» and
  «Маршрутизация по домену». All three were removed by an EARLIER owner decision
  recorded in LocalProxyActivity's own header — the memory limit because no shipped
  libv2ray build exposes a setter for it, so the control changed nothing; the other
  two because they were second homes for settings that live in «Дополнительно».
  The handoff was drawn from the pre-decision screen, so it is not asking for them
  back. Not re-added.
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="?android:attr/colorBackground"
    android:fitsSystemWindows="true"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    tools:context=".ui.LocalProxyActivity">

    <include
        android:id="@+id/toolbar"
        layout="@layout/view_sub_header" />

    <androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView
        android:id="@+id/main_content"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:layout_weight="1"
        android:clipToPadding="false"
        android:paddingBottom="@dimen/space_32"
        android:scrollbars="none">

        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:orientation="vertical">

            <!-- ==================== ПРОКСИ И ДОСТУП ====================
                 Мастер-переключатель всей группы стоит первым на экране: он решает,
                 существуют ли инбаунды вообще, а логин с паролем ниже — деталь одного
                 из них. -->
            <TextView
                style="@style/SettingsSectionLabel"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:text="@string/lp_section_local" />

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView style="@style/Widget.Departament.CardSection">

                <LinearLayout style="@style/Widget.Departament.CardSection.Body">

                    <!-- Локальный прокси: SOCKS5/HTTP инбаунды ядра (PREF_ENABLE_LOCAL_PROXY) -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/row_local_proxy"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Row"
                        android:baselineAligned="false">

                        <ImageView
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Tile"
                            android:backgroundTint="?attr/colorSurfaceContainerHighest"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_16"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_hub_local_proxy" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="@string/lp_local_proxy"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:text="@string/lp_local_proxy_sub"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <com.google.android.material.materialswitch.MaterialSwitch
                            android:id="@+id/switch_local_proxy"
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Switch"
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:clickable="false"
                            android:focusable="false"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.divider.MaterialDivider
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Divider.Full"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

                    <!-- Адрес и порт локального прокси. Раньше оба поля лежали внутри
                         group_socks_details и показывались, только когда включена
                         SOCKS5-авторизация: при выключенной авторизации, а это состояние по
                         умолчанию, порт локального прокси нельзя было ни увидеть, ни изменить. -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:orientation="vertical"
                        android:paddingStart="@dimen/screen_gutter"
                        android:paddingTop="@dimen/space_12"
                        android:paddingEnd="@dimen/screen_gutter"
                        android:paddingBottom="@dimen/space_16">

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="@string/lp_socks_address"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                        <EditText
                            android:id="@+id/et_socks_addr"
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                            android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                            android:enabled="false"
                            android:focusable="false"
                            android:inputType="none"
                            android:maxLines="1"
                            android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:text="127.0.0.1"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
                            tools:ignore="HardcodedText,LabelFor" />

                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:text="@string/lp_socks_port"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                        <EditText
                            android:id="@+id/et_socks_port"
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                            android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                            android:inputType="number"
                            android:maxLines="1"
                            android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface"
                            tools:ignore="LabelFor"
                            tools:text="10808" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.divider.MaterialDivider
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Divider.Full"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

                    <!-- UDP через прокси -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/row_udp"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Row"
                        android:baselineAligned="false">

                        <ImageView
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Tile"
                            android:backgroundTint="?attr/colorSurfaceContainerHighest"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_16"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_lp_udp" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="@string/lp_udp"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:text="@string/lp_udp_sub"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <com.google.android.material.materialswitch.MaterialSwitch
                            android:id="@+id/switch_udp"
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Switch"
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:clickable="false"
                            android:focusable="false"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.divider.MaterialDivider
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Divider.Full"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

                    <!-- Системный HTTP-прокси -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/row_http_proxy"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Row"
                        android:baselineAligned="false">

                        <ImageView
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Tile"
                            android:backgroundTint="?attr/colorSurfaceContainerHighest"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_16"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_lp_http" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="@string/lp_http_proxy"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:text="@string/lp_http_proxy_sub"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <com.google.android.material.materialswitch.MaterialSwitch
                            android:id="@+id/switch_http_proxy"
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Switch"
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:clickable="false"
                            android:focusable="false"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.divider.MaterialDivider
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Divider.Full"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

                    <!-- Доступ через хотспот -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/row_hotspot"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Row"
                        android:baselineAligned="false">

                        <ImageView
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Tile"
                            android:backgroundTint="?attr/colorSurfaceContainerHighest"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_16"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_lp_hotspot" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="@string/lp_hotspot"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:text="@string/lp_hotspot_sub"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <com.google.android.material.materialswitch.MaterialSwitch
                            android:id="@+id/switch_hotspot"
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Switch"
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:clickable="false"
                            android:focusable="false"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <!-- Эндпоинт для подключаемых устройств (виден при включённом доступе) -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/group_hotspot_details"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:orientation="vertical"
                        android:paddingStart="@dimen/screen_gutter"
                        android:paddingEnd="@dimen/screen_gutter"
                        android:paddingBottom="@dimen/space_16"
                        android:visibility="gone"
                        tools:visibility="visible">

                        <!-- Пояснение: ручной SOCKS5-прокси, а не сквозной перехват -->
                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:text="@string/lp_hotspot_hint"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                        <!-- Предупреждение о локальной сети. Единственный цветной текст на
                             экране: ?attr/warning — это роль «истекает / внимание», и она
                             существует ровно для такой строки (colors.xml, attrs.xml). -->
                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_8"
                            android:text="@string/lp_hotspot_warning"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption"
                            android:textColor="?attr/warning" />

                        <!-- SOCKS5 адрес:порт -->
                        <TextView
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:text="@string/lp_hotspot_endpoint"
                            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                            android:baselineAligned="false"
                            android:gravity="center_vertical"
                            android:orientation="horizontal">

                            <EditText
                                android:id="@+id/et_hotspot_endpoint"
                                android:layout_width="0dp"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_weight="1"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                                android:enabled="false"
                                android:focusable="false"
                                android:inputType="none"
                                android:maxLines="1"
                                android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                                android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface"
                                tools:ignore="LabelFor"
                                tools:text="SOCKS5  192.168.1.42:10810" />

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_copy_hotspot_endpoint"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_copy"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_copy"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <!-- Логин -->
                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:baselineAligned="false"
                            android:gravity="bottom"
                            android:orientation="horizontal">

                            <LinearLayout
                                android:layout_width="0dp"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_weight="1"
                                android:orientation="vertical">

                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:text="@string/lp_socks_login"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                                <EditText
                                    android:id="@+id/et_hotspot_user"
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                    android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                                    android:enabled="false"
                                    android:focusable="false"
                                    android:inputType="none"
                                    android:maxLines="1"
                                    android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                                    android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface"
                                    tools:ignore="LabelFor"
                                    tools:text="dep_a1b2c3" />
                            </LinearLayout>

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_copy_hotspot_user"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_copy"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_copy"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <!-- Пароль -->
                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:baselineAligned="false"
                            android:gravity="bottom"
                            android:orientation="horizontal">

                            <LinearLayout
                                android:layout_width="0dp"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_weight="1"
                                android:orientation="vertical">

                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:text="@string/lp_socks_password"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                                <EditText
                                    android:id="@+id/et_hotspot_pass"
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                    android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                                    android:enabled="false"
                                    android:focusable="false"
                                    android:inputType="textPassword"
                                    android:maxLines="1"
                                    android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                                    android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface"
                                    tools:ignore="LabelFor"
                                    tools:text="a1b2c3d4e5f6" />
                            </LinearLayout>

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_toggle_hotspot_pass"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_show_password"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_lp_eye"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_copy_hotspot_pass"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_copy"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_copy"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                        </LinearLayout>
                    </LinearLayout>
                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <!-- ==================== УЧЁТНЫЕ ДАННЫЕ ==================== -->
            <TextView
                style="@style/SettingsSectionLabel"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:text="@string/lp_section_socks" />

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView style="@style/Widget.Departament.CardSection">

                <LinearLayout style="@style/Widget.Departament.CardSection.Body">

                    <!-- Мастер-переключатель -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/row_socks_auth"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Row"
                        android:baselineAligned="false">

                        <ImageView
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Tile"
                            android:backgroundTint="?attr/colorSurfaceContainerHighest"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_16"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_lp_key" />

                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:orientation="vertical">

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:text="@string/lp_socks_auth"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:text="@string/lp_socks_auth_sub"
                                android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <com.google.android.material.materialswitch.MaterialSwitch
                            android:id="@+id/switch_socks_auth"
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Switch"
                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:clickable="false"
                            android:focusable="false"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no" />
                    </LinearLayout>

                    <com.google.android.material.divider.MaterialDivider
                        android:id="@+id/divider_socks"
                        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Divider.Full"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

                    <!-- Поля авторизации (видны при включённом мастере) -->
                    <LinearLayout
                        android:id="@+id/group_socks_details"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:orientation="vertical"
                        android:paddingStart="@dimen/screen_gutter"
                        android:paddingTop="@dimen/space_12"
                        android:paddingEnd="@dimen/screen_gutter"
                        android:paddingBottom="@dimen/space_16"
                        android:visibility="gone"
                        tools:visibility="visible">

                        <!-- Логин -->
                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:baselineAligned="false"
                            android:gravity="bottom"
                            android:orientation="horizontal">

                            <LinearLayout
                                android:layout_width="0dp"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_weight="1"
                                android:orientation="vertical">

                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:text="@string/lp_socks_login"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                                <EditText
                                    android:id="@+id/et_socks_user"
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                    android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                                    android:inputType="text"
                                    android:maxLines="1"
                                    android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                                    android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface"
                                    tools:ignore="LabelFor"
                                    tools:text="dep_a1b2c3" />
                            </LinearLayout>

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_copy_user"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_copy"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_copy"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <!-- Пароль -->
                        <LinearLayout
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_12"
                            android:baselineAligned="false"
                            android:gravity="bottom"
                            android:orientation="horizontal">

                            <LinearLayout
                                android:layout_width="0dp"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_weight="1"
                                android:orientation="vertical">

                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:text="@string/lp_socks_password"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />

                                <EditText
                                    android:id="@+id/et_socks_pass"
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_4"
                                    android:background="@drawable/bg_lp_input"
                                    android:inputType="textPassword"
                                    android:maxLines="1"
                                    android:padding="@dimen/space_12"
                                    android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
                                    android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface"
                                    tools:ignore="LabelFor"
                                    tools:text="a1b2c3d4e5f6" />
                            </LinearLayout>

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_toggle_pass"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/space_4"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_show_password"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_lp_eye"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />

                            <ImageButton
                                android:id="@+id/btn_copy_pass"
                                android:layout_width="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:layout_height="@dimen/view_height_dp48"
                                android:background="@drawable/bg_control_disc"
                                android:contentDescription="@string/lp_copy"
                                android:stateListAnimator="@anim/press_icon"
                                app:srcCompat="@drawable/ic_copy"
                                app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                        </LinearLayout>

                        <!-- Сбросить учётные данные -->
                        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                            android:id="@+id/btn_reset_creds"
                            style="@style/Widget.Departament.Button.Secondary"
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_16"
                            android:text="@string/lp_socks_reset"
                            app:icon="@drawable/ic_refresh_24dp"
                            app:iconGravity="textStart" />
                    </LinearLayout>
                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>
        </LinearLayout>
    </androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView>
</LinearLayout>
